  'Diagnostics expose stable status and error codes only. Provider responses and stored credentials are never rendered in the browser.': "诊断信息只显示固定的状态和错误代码，不会在浏览器中显示服务商原始响应或已保存的凭证。",
  'Account Analytics Read is required for sync. Add Workers Scripts Read to discover names automatically; manual entry remains available.': "同步需要 Account Analytics Read 权限；增加 Workers Scripts Read 可自动发现名称，也可以手动填写。",
