  'Keep the secret server-side. Replace the value placeholder with a real aggregate from your product.': '请将密钥保留在服务端，并把示例值替换为产品的真实汇总数据。',
  'Dashloom checks persisted points, key use, and specialist readiness. It never inserts a test point for you.': 'Dashloom 会检查已保存的数据点、密钥使用情况和分析师就绪状态，不会替你插入测试数据点。',
  'Production business database': '生产业务数据库', 'D1 database ID': 'D1 数据库 ID', 'D1 Read token': 'D1 只读令牌', 'Date result column': '日期结果列', 'Read-only aggregate query': '只读汇总查询',
  'Metric mapping (query column → Dashloom metric)': '指标映射（查询列 → Dashloom 指标）', 'Sync D1 metrics': '同步 D1 指标',
  'Dashloom accepts one SELECT/WITH query, rejects mutation syntax, checks that Cloudflare reports zero rows written, and never returns your token to the browser.': 'Dashloom 仅接受一条 SELECT/WITH 查询，拒绝数据修改语法，验证 Cloudflare 报告的写入行数为零，并且绝不会把令牌返回给浏览器。',
  'Create metric': '创建指标', 'Signup conversion': '注册转化率', 'Right side': "右侧类型", 'Formulas align product, date, and currency. They never execute code or mix currencies.': "公式会按产品、日期和币种对齐数据，不会执行代码，也不会混合不同币种。",
  'Custom REST endpoint': '自定义 REST 端点', 'Custom API key header': '自定义 API Key 请求头', 'Header name': '请求头名称', 'Bearer token': 'Bearer 令牌', 'Encrypted and never displayed again': '加密保存且不再显示',
  'Evidence rows': "竞品数据", 'Product analytics': "产品使用数据", 'Acquisition': '获客', 'Commercial': '商业', 'Command': '命令',
  'YYYY-MM-DD, metric_name, numeric_value, optional source URL. URLs are preserved as provenance for agent citations.': '格式：YYYY-MM-DD、指标名称、数值、可选来源 URL。URL 会作为 Agent 引用的来源信息保留。',
  'Use a restricted server key with read access to Account, Balance transactions, and Subscriptions. Only the account default currency is imported.': "请使用仅允许读取账户、余额交易和订阅的受限服务端密钥。系统只导入该账户的默认币种数据。",
  'Create a Lemon Squeezy API key and enter the numeric Store ID. Dashloom reads the Store, recent Orders, Subscriptions, and referenced Prices; test-mode records and usage-based MRR are excluded.': "请创建 Lemon Squeezy API Key，并填写数字格式的商店 ID。Dashloom 会读取商店、近期订单、订阅及关联价格；测试模式记录和按用量计算的 MRR 不会导入。",
  'Generate one user-level key in Bing Webmaster Tools → Settings → API Access. Dashloom encrypts it and imports only verified sites and aggregated search evidence.': "请在 Bing 站长工具的“设置 → API 访问”中生成用户级密钥。Dashloom 会加密保存，并且只导入已验证站点及聚合后的搜索证据。",
  'Grant only projects:read and analytics usage read. Dashloom never reads database tables, Auth users, logs, API keys, or project secrets.': '仅授予 projects:read 和 analytics usage read 权限。Dashloom 绝不会读取数据库表、Auth 用户、日志、API Key 或项目密钥。',
  'Grant only transaction.read and adjustment.read. Dashloom stores daily currency totals, refunds, chargebacks, and counts—not customer, address, invoice, item, or transaction identities.': "仅授予 transaction.read 和 adjustment.read 权限。Dashloom 只保存按天、按币种汇总的收入、退款、拒付和数量，不保存客户、地址、发票、商品或交易身份信息。",
