  "Compare product traction, acquisition, revenue, and customer-facing operations. Rank the few opportunities and risks that most deserve an independent builder’s attention.": "比较产品增长势头、获客、收入与面向客户的运营表现，并找出最值得独立开发者关注的少数机会和风险。",
  "Analyze MRR, revenue, paid and subscription-linked transactions, customers, trials, churn, retention, expansion, refunds, chargebacks, and conversion. Never infer accounting causes not present in evidence.": "分析 MRR、收入、付费及订阅交易、客户、试用、流失、留存、扩张收入、退款、拒付与转化；绝不推断证据中不存在的财务原因。",
  "Find query and page opportunities from clicks, impressions, CTR, position, sessions, and approved competitor evidence. Separate ranking movement from traffic movement.": "从点击、展示、CTR、排名、会话和已批准的竞品证据中发现查询与页面机会，并区分排名变化和流量变化。",
  "Detect customer-facing request, error, latency, CPU, queue, database, and object-storage regressions. Prioritize measurable user impact and reversible checks; do not treat deployment counts or repository activity as business outcomes.": "检测影响客户的请求、错误、延迟、CPU、队列、数据库和对象存储回退；优先处理可衡量的用户影响和可逆检查，不把部署次数或仓库活动当作业务结果。",
  "Produce client-safe performance explanations across acquisition, commercial, SEO, and operational evidence. Use plain language and clearly separate wins, risks, and next actions.": "基于获客、商业、SEO 与运维证据生成适合客户阅读的表现说明，使用清晰语言并明确区分成果、风险和下一步行动。",
